[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0476","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0476.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1152","title":"GNU Binutils ld 组件 xstrdup 函数内存泄漏漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 的 ld 组件中 xstrdup.c 文件的 xstrdup 函数存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401）。攻击者可通过远程方式利用该漏洞，但攻击复杂度较高且利用难度较大。该漏洞影响 GNU Binutils 2.43 版本，可能导致目标系统内存资源被逐渐耗尽，影响链接器正常运行。目前漏洞细节已公开，厂商建议应用补丁修复，相关泄漏问题已在 binutils master 分支上修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1152"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T18:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:28Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Binutils 至 master 分支最新提交（所有内存泄漏已在 master 修复）。SUSE Linux 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:4096-1 更新至 binutils 2.4 版本。如无法立即更新，避免在 ld 链接过程中使用不受信任的输入文件，以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15887","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32576","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295056","https://vuldb.com/?id.295056","https://www.gnu.org/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1152.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2025/CVE-2025-1152.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1152.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1152.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11524.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11523.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11529.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11525.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11527.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11522.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0476.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0475","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0475.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1151","title":"GNU Binutils ld 组件 xmemdup 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 2.43 版本的 ld 组件中的 xmemdup.c 文件存在内存泄漏漏洞。该漏洞源于 xmemdup 函数在处理内存分配时未正确释放已分配的内存，导致资源泄漏。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的二进制文件触发该漏洞，但攻击复杂度较高且利用难度较大。成功利用可能导致目标系统资源耗尽，影响程序稳定性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分仅 2.3，危害等级低。GNU 官方已在 master 分支修复此问题，建议用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1151"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T17:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:28Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Binutils 至 2.45 或更高版本，从 binutils master 分支拉取包含 xmemdup 内存泄漏修复的最新代码重新编译。SUSE Linux 用户可通过 zypper 安装 SUSE-SU-2025:4096-1 更新至 2.45 版本。如无法立即升级，可在 ld 链接过程中避免处理不可信二进制文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15887","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32576","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295055","https://vuldb.com/?id.295055","https://www.gnu.org/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1151.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2025/CVE-2025-1151.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1151.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1151.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11514.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11516.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11512.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11519.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11513.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11515.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0475.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0474","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0474.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1150","title":"GNU Binutils ld 组件 libbfd.c 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 2.43 版本的 ld 组件中 libbfd.c 文件的 bfd_malloc 函数存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401）。攻击者可通过远程方式触发该漏洞，导致目标系统内存资源被逐渐耗尽，进而影响链接器正常运行。由于攻击复杂度较高且利用难度较大，实际利用场景有限。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.3，危害等级低。目前官方已在 master 分支修复，但 2.44 分支尚未合入补丁。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1150"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T17:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:28Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Binutils 至 2.44 或更高版本（所有内存泄漏已在 master 分支修复）。SUSE Linux 用户可通过 SUSE-SU-2025:4096-1 更新至 binutils 2.4 版本。如无法立即升级，避免在 ld 链接过程中使用不受信任的输入文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15887","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32576","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295054","https://vuldb.com/?id.295054","https://www.gnu.org/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1150.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2025/CVE-2025-1150.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1150.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1150.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11509.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11508.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11503.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11505.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11506.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11507.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0474.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0931","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0931.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21693","title":"Linux 内核 zswap 使用后释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 zswap 压缩交换子系统存在释放后重用漏洞。在 zswap_compress() 和 zswap_decompress() 函数中，代码获取并使用当前 CPU 的 per-CPU acomp_ctx 结构体以完成压缩或解压缩操作，但由于未禁用抢占或禁止迁移，进程可能在操作执行期间被调度到其他 CPU 上运行。若原始 CPU 在此过程中被热卸载，而 acomp_ctx 仍然处于被使用状态，则会触发释放后重用：acomp_ctx 所关联的资源（如压缩缓冲区、请求对象或异步压缩引擎）会在 zswap_cpu_comp_dead() 中被提前释放，导致攻击者可通过竞争条件利用该漏洞执行任意代码或造成系统崩溃。该漏洞影响启用了 zswap 功能的 Linux 内核版本，攻击者需在目标系统上拥有低权限本地访问权限，无需用户交互即可触发，成功利用后可实现本地权限提升或拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21693"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T16:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:02Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.12 或 6.13 及以上版本，该补丁通过 commit 12dcb0ef5406 修复 mm/zswap.c 中 CPU 热插拔时的 UAF 漏洞。Ubuntu 24.04/24.10 Azure 内核用户请升级至 6.11.0-1013.13 或更高版本；RHEL 9 用户请安装 RHSA-2025:20518 安全更新；SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 用户请安装 SUSE-SU-2025:01967-1 安全更新。如短期无法升级，可在访问控制层面严格限制具备 CAP_SYS_ADMIN 权限的本地用户，并避免在不需要的场景下执行 CPU 热插拔操作。更新后需重启系统以使内核补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/12dcb0ef540629a281533f9dedc1b6b8e14cfb65","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8d29ff5d50304daa41dc3cfdda4a9d1e46cf5be1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21693.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21693.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21693.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21693.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21693.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21693.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21693","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/89fbba38c2d6be5ae7165c8ae7c8f3c0641ea56f/tracker/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-21693.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21693","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-216xx/CVE-2025-21693.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0931.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0930","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0930.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21692","title":"Linux 内核 ETS qdisc 越界索引本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核网络调度模块（net/sched）中的 ETS qdisc 实现存在数组越界索引漏洞。攻击者利用该漏洞需要通过 tc 命令经由 netlink socket 向内核传递特制的 tclass 配置参数，当传入的 classid（clid）为 0 时，ets_class_from_arg() 函数会错误地计算数组下标并越界访问仅含 16 个元素的 ets_class 数组，导致越界读写。成功利用可造成本地权限提升。该漏洞影响使用了 ETS（Earliest TxTime First）排队规则的内核版本，CVSS 评分为 7.8，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，且无需用户交互即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21692"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T16:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:02Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至安全版本：5.10.234、5.15.178、6.1.128、6.6.75、6.12.12 或 6.13.1 及更高版本。补丁对 net/sched/sch_ets.c 中 ets_class_from_arg() 函数增加了 arg == 0 或 arg > nbands 的边界检查。如暂无法升级，可临时禁用 ETS qdisc 以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/03c56665dab1f4ac844bc156652d50d639093fa5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1332c6ed446be787f901ed1064ec6a3c694f028a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/997f6ec4208b23c87daf9f044689685f091826f7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bcf0d815e728a3a304b50455b32a3170c16e1eaa","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d62b04fca4340a0d468d7853bd66e511935a18cb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f4168299e553f17aa2ba4016e77a9c38da40eb1d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f6b0f05fbfa4044f890e8a348288c0d9a20bd1d0","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-355557.html","https://github.com/volticks/CVE-2025-21692-poc","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21692.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21692.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/2204bbca7a1888da763370fee251c1e100b26ce8/2025/CVE-2025-21692.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/4b2b5b9de550f9fd0e6819710aea6e044dfbc047/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-21692.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/fb5f206c909d2a25672d2f7083207d9364c4215a/2025/CVE-2025-21692.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21692.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/4b2b5b9de550f9fd0e6819710aea6e044dfbc047/data/2025/CVE-2025-21692-volticks_CVE-2025-21692-poc.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21756.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21692.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21692.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0930.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0930.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0929","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0929.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21690","title":"Linux 内核 SCSI storvsc 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SCSI storvsc 驱动在 Hyper-V 虚拟化环境中存在资源限速缺失漏洞。当 hypervisor 出现持续性错误时，该驱动会针对失败的 I/O 操作大量输出警告日志，导致内核日志缓冲区被淹没且 CPU 利用率被耗尽，进而使虚拟机无法正常进行故障排查和运行，造成拒绝服务。影响范围包括运行在 Hyper-V 上的 Linux 虚拟机及使用 storvsc 半虚拟化 SCSI 驱动的内核版本。攻击条件为攻击者需具备本地访问权限，并能在 hypervisor 侧制造或利用持续性错误来触发日志洪泛。攻击者可借此对目标 VM 发起拒绝服务攻击，阻塞系统管理员的排查工作，严重时可导致虚拟化业务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21690"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T16:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:01Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至已修复版本：5.15.178、6.1.128、6.6.75、6.12.12、6.13.1 或 6.14 及以上版本。对于主流发行版，Debian bookworm 请升级至内核 6.1.128-1 或更高，Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 请升级至 5.15.0-135.146 或更高，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 请升级至 6.8.0-62.65 或更高，CentOS/RHEL 9 请升级至 kernel-6.6.75 或更高。使用 `uname -r` 确认当前内核版本，受影响范围为 4.5 至上述修复版本之间的所有内核。如无法立即升级内核，可在 Hyper-V 宿主机端排查并修复 storvsc 后端存储的持续性错误，从根源上消除触发条件，作为临时缓解措施。该漏洞存在于 drivers/scsi/storvsc_drv.c 中，仅影响通过 Hyper-V 虚拟化运行的 Linux 虚拟机，补丁通过 rate limit 机制限制了 storvsc 驱动在 I/O 失败时的内核日志输出频率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/01d1ebdab9ccb73c952e1666a8a80abd194dbc55","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/088bde862f8d3d0fc52e40e66a0484a246837087","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/182a4b7c731e95c08cb47f14b87a272b6ab2b2da","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/81d4dd05c412ba04f9f6b85b718e6da833be290c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d0f0af1bafef33b3e2aa8c3a4ef44db48df9b0ea","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d2138eab8cde61e0e6f62d0713e45202e8457d6d","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21690.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21690.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21690.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21690.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21690.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21690.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21690.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21690.json","https://github.com/RedHatProductSecurity/aegis-ai/blob/2e1430d90ca3b8234fa3c3fd031fd0135ed9cf5c/evals/osidb_cache/CVE-2025-21690.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2025/CVE-2025-21690.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0929.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0928","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0928.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21689","title":"Linux 内核 USB 串口 Quatech2 驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux kernel 的 USB 串行驱动中，Quatech2 设备的 qt2_process_read_urb() 函数存在空指针解引用漏洞。该函数在处理 USB 串行设备读取请求时，对端口索引的边界检查不正确，原代码仅判断 newport 是否大于 serial->num_ports，未涵盖等于的情况，导致当 newport 等于 serial->num_ports 时，serial->port 数组发生越界访问并返回 NULL，后续 dereference 操作引发内核崩溃。具有本地低权限的攻击者可通过向 Quatech2 USB 串行设备发送特制数据包触发此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 quatech2 驱动的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。修复补丁已通过增加 newport 大于等于 num_ports 的边界检查解决此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21689"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T16:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:01Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含修复的稳定版本：5.4.290、5.10.234、5.15.178、6.1.128、6.6.75 或 6.12.12 及以上。使用发行版包管理器更新内核（如 Debian/Ubuntu 执行 apt install linux-image-* && apt upgrade，RHEL/CentOS 执行 yum update kernel），更新后重启系统加载新内核。如暂时无法升级，可将 quatech2 模块加入黑名单（echo \"blacklist quatech2\" >> /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist.conf 并执行 update-initramfs -u）作为临时缓解措施，阻止该 USB 串口驱动自动加载，避免触发空指针解引用导致内核崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4b9b41fabcd38990f69ef0cee9c631d954a2b530","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/575a5adf48b06a2980c9eeffedf699ed5534fade","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6068dcff7f19e9fa6fa23ee03453ad6a40fa4efe","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6377838560c03b36e1153a42ef727533def9b68f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8542b33622571f54dfc2a267fce378b6e3840b8b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/94770cf7c5124f0268d481886829dc2beecc4507","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f371471708c7d997f763b0e70565026eb67cc470","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fa4c7472469d97c4707698b4c0e098f8cfc2bf22","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21689.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21689.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21689.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21689.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21689.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21689.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21689.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21689-2025-11-03-1453","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21689-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21689.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0928.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0927","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0927.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21687","title":"Linux 内核 vfio/platform 越界读写漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 vfio/platform 子系统中，read/write syscalls 未对用户空间传入的 count 和 offset 参数进行充分边界校验，仅对 offset 做了 40 位上限限制，攻击者可通过构造超出设备内存映射范围的偏移量和长度，触发越界读写操作。该漏洞影响搭载 vfio/platform 驱动的 Linux 内核版本，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，无需用户交互即可利用。成功利用可导致内核内存信息泄露或权限提升，进而获取系统控制权。建议用户将内核升级至修复该漏洞的稳定版本以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21687"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T16:15:38Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:19:12Z","remediation":"升级Linux内核到已修复版本：5.4.290、5.10.234、5.15.178、6.1.128、6.6.75、6.12.12或更高版本。Debian/Ubuntu系统可执行apt update && apt upgrade安装linux-image更新包；RHEL/CentOS系统使用yum update kernel或dnf update kernel安装最新内核。更新后重启系统使新内核生效。若短期内无法升级，可通过chmod 660 /dev/vfio/*并设置专属用户组的方式限制本地非特权用户对vfio设备的访问，临时缓解越界读写风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1485932496a1b025235af8aa1e21988d6b7ccd54","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/665cfd1083866f87301bbd232cb8ba48dcf4acce","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6bcb8a5b70b80143db9bf12dfa7d53636f824d53","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/92340e6c5122d823ad064984ef7513eba9204048","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9377cdc118cf327248f1a9dde7b87de067681dc9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a20fcaa230f7472456d12cf761ed13938e320ac3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c981c32c38af80737a2fedc16e270546d139ccdd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ce9ff21ea89d191e477a02ad7eabf4f996b80a69","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d19a8650fd3d7aed8d1af1d9a77f979a8430eba1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ed81d82bb6e9df3a137f2c343ed689e6c68268ef","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f21636f24b6786c8b13f1af4319fa75ffcf17f38","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f65ce06387f8c1fb54bd59e18a8428248ec68eaf","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21687.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21687.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21687.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21687.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21687-2025-11-03-1453","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21687-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2025/CVE-2025-21687.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21687.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2025/CVE-2025-21687.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21687"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0927.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0471","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0471.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1149","title":"GNU Binutils ld 组件 xstrdup 函数内存泄漏漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 2.43 版本的链接器组件（ld）中 libiberty/xmalloc.c 文件的 xstrdup 函数存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401）。该漏洞源于程序在内存分配后未能正确释放已分配的内存，导致资源耗尽。攻击者需要较高的攻击复杂度且利用难度较大，但理论上可通过远程方式触发该漏洞，造成目标系统内存资源逐渐耗尽，影响链接器正常功能。该漏洞影响 GNU Binutils 2.43 版本，CVSS 评分 2.3，危害等级低。官方已在 binutils master 分支中修复此问题，建议用户更新至修复版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1149"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T15:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:28Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Binutils 至 master 分支最新提交（所有内存泄漏已在 master 修复），或安装发行版厂商补丁（如 SUSE 已发布 SUSE-SU-2025:4096-1 更新至 binutils 2.4 版本）。如无法立即更新，可在编译时禁用 ld 的 -z gcs=implicit 选项作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15887","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32576","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295053","https://vuldb.com/?id.295053","https://www.gnu.org/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1149.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ab396be03b208767ce22804ad16877ccef3b54c/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1149.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1149.json","https://github.com/grafana/grafana-image-renderer/blob/0a918126b9e7fd11d49cb100c32a439da9d3d30d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-1149","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2025/CVE-2025-1149.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-1149.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7fe82fb470b3291b506f74c6717a29e3837f8a29/2025/CVE-2025-11492.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2025-1149-gnu-binutils-ld-xmallocc-xstrdup-mem-1767883001000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-vwfw-r6qw-22rw/GHSA-vwfw-r6qw-22rw.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0471.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0470","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0470.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1148","title":"GNU Binutils ld 组件 link_order_scan 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 的 ld 链接器组件中 ld/ldelfgen.c 文件的 link_order_scan 函数存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401）。远程攻击者可通过向受影响系统提交特制的链接输入文件触发该漏洞，导致进程内存资源未被正确释放，长期运行可能造成系统资源耗尽。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要用户交互（如诱使用户处理恶意文件），且仅影响可用性，不涉及机密性和完整性。GNU Binutils 2.43 版本受影响，维护者已在 master 分支修复所有已知泄漏，但未合入 2.44 分支以避免稳定性风险。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1148"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T14:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:27Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Binutils 至 2.44 或更高版本（所有内存泄漏已在 master 分支修复）。SUSE 用户可安装 SUSE-SU-2025:4096-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，避免在 ld 链接过程中使用受影响的功能模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15887","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32576","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295052","https://vuldb.com/?id.295052","https://vuldb.com/?submit.485747","https://www.gnu.org/","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250404-0004/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1148.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ab396be03b208767ce22804ad16877ccef3b54c/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1148.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1148.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2025-1148","https://github.com/grafana/grafana-image-renderer/blob/0a918126b9e7fd11d49cb100c32a439da9d3d30d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1148.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9e840c51f12aff4a18b8c50d63ae898b6e33f403/references/CVE-2025-1148-2025-04-04-2205","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-1148.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-1148","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11485.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0470.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0469","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0469.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1147","title":"GNU Binutils nm 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 2.43 版本的 nm 工具中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞位于 binutils/nm.c 文件的 __sanitizer::internal_strlen 函数中，攻击者通过操控 const 参数可触发缓冲区溢出，导致程序异常行为。由于攻击复杂度较高且利用难度较大，实际利用较为困难。该漏洞影响 GNU Binutils 2.43 版本，CVSS 评分 2.3，危害等级低。建议用户升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1147"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T14:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:27Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Binutils 至 2.44 或更高版本。对于 SUSE 系统，安装 SUSE-SU-2025:4096-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，避免对不可信二进制文件使用 nm 工具的 --debug 或 -w 选项，并限制 nm 命令的执行权限以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15881","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32556","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.295051","https://vuldb.com/?id.295051","https://vuldb.com/?submit.485254","https://www.gnu.org/","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250404-0003/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1147.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e9d9f63ec95233a18ff0c401191fddd414b539a/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1147.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c21137571cced5c6655bc31f22872abfb39df64b/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1147.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-1147","https://github.com/grafana/grafana-image-renderer/blob/0a918126b9e7fd11d49cb100c32a439da9d3d30d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-1147.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11473.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-11476.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9e840c51f12aff4a18b8c50d63ae898b6e33f403/references/CVE-2025-1147-2025-04-04-2205","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-11474.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0469.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0926","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0926.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21684","title":"Linux 内核 Xilinx GPIO 驱动不当锁漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Linux 内核 Xilinx GPIO 驱动存在 improper locking 漏洞。该驱动在实现中断控制器接口时使用普通 spinlock（gpio_lock）进行内部保护，但 irq_chip 函数可能在 raw spinlock 上下文（如中断处理路径）中被调用，导致内核锁依赖检查器触发无效等待上下文警告，进而可能引发系统死锁或拒绝服务。受影响版本包括使用 Xilinx ZynqMP 等平台的 Linux 内核。攻击者需在本地系统上以低权限运行，通过触发 GPIO 中断处理流程即可复现该问题，导致系统可用性受影响。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21684"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-09T12:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:01Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至已修复该问题的稳定版本：5.15.x 系列升级到 5.15.179 或更高版本，6.1.x 系列升级到 6.1.129 或更高版本，6.6.x 系列升级到 6.6.74 或更高版本，6.7 至 6.12.x 系列升级到 6.12.11 或更高版本，6.13-rc 系列升级到包含 commit 9860370c2172 的版本。以 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 为例，应安装 linux-image-5.15.0-1084-generic 或更高版本的内核包并重启系统。如无法立即升级内核，可通过禁用 Xilinx GPIO 中断控制器作为临时缓解措施，但该操作会影响使用 Xilinx GPIO 中断的相关硬件功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9860370c2172704b6b4f0075a0c2a29fd84af96a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9c035105c5537d2ecad6b9415e9417a1ffbd0a62","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b0111650ee596219bb5defa0ce1a1308e6e77ccf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d25041d4a3b2af64c888cf762362b2528ba59294","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f0ed2d0abc021f56fa27dc6d0770535c1851a43b","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21684.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21684.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21684.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21684.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21684-2025-11-03-1401","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21684.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21684","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/89fbba38c2d6be5ae7165c8ae7c8f3c0641ea56f/tracker/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-21684.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/1223cbae826d36076610fd417938eaf4247afd93/references/contrib1-CveServices-CVE-2025-21684-2025-11-03-1401","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21684.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0926.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0869","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0869.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21408","title":"Microsoft Edge（基于 Chromium）远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Edge（Chromium 内核）存在类型混淆远程代码执行漏洞（CWE-843）。攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意网页，诱使用户在受影响版本的 Edge 浏览器中访问，触发 Chromium 渲染引擎在处理页面对象时的类型混淆错误，从而在沙箱环境下执行任意代码。该漏洞无需攻击者身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接或浏览恶意页面），CVSS 评分 8.8，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中发布 Edge 133.0.3065.51 版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21408"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-06T23:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:17Z","remediation":"立即将 Microsoft Edge 升级至 133.0.3065.51 或更高版本，可通过浏览器菜单「设置」→「关于 Microsoft Edge」自动检查并安装更新，或通过 Microsoft Update Catalog 下载离线安装包。企业环境可通过组策略配置自动更新策略，确保浏览器及时接收安全更新。作为临时缓解措施，可配置 Edge 的「增强安全模式」并限制用户访问不受信任的站点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21408","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21408.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4683223ae150496144b181156e51d2b32e6b15f8/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21408.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21408.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21408.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21408.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21408.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-214xx/CVE-2025-21408.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21408/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2025/CVE-2025-21408.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21408/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0869.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0865","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0865.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21404","title":"Microsoft Edge (Chromium-based) 欺骗漏洞","description":"Microsoft Edge（Chromium 内核）存在欺骗漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意网页，诱使用户在浏览器中点击或交互，导致浏览器 UI 内容被伪造或篡改，用户可能误认为正在访问合法站点而泄露敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Edge 133.0.3065.51 之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，但需要用户交互配合。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21404"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-06T23:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:17Z","remediation":"立即将 Microsoft Edge 升级至 133.0.3065.51 或更高版本，可通过 Edge 设置 > 关于 Microsoft Edge 检查更新自动安装。如无法立即更新，可在浏览器设置中启用「增强安全模式」并禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，同时教育用户不要点击可疑链接。企业环境可通过组策略或 Microsoft Endpoint Manager 批量推送更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21404","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21404.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21404.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/